  "v2_1_change": "stage2 v2.1 keeps v2 (no defend, own-quadrant 20R opening bonus) and enables the accepted guard+F1 additions from corrected evaluation: observation_detour with extra_limit=2, attempt_limit=1, min_tick=8, max_known_resources=1, and resource_arrival_value. Corrected paired tests vs v2: B1 R 51.76 vs 50.88, score 41.66 vs 40.88, rank 1.853 vs 2.059, top-two 26 vs 23; B2 R 49.38 vs 49.38, score 41.14 vs 40.99, rank 2.062 vs 2.125, top-two 21 vs 20. Behavior changed in 12/34 B1 and 9/32 B2 trajectories; AI-off, mock referee, frozen opponents. R target base+2 was not met; B1 deaths 9.06 vs 8.24 and real-LLM conditions remain unverified."
